{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f3fcd11857d54c53c193a1fbe58ea2921f96bf531e827790c0c503843853f69", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nひなたの撮影は、とても順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n日向的拍摄进行得非常顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "0b5f2ed4c5786ac3f4e64bc6ed2e277ef1eda9e43a3e754cba26479ef4c85f27", "ja": "お疲れさんです、{$P$}。\n休憩時間に入るのが、予定より早くないかい？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n是不是比预定时间更早进入休息时间了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f9f9dbb24c6da6c63516ab79dadb53cd19ef9c77cc67332fc41b119cd95050c9", "ja": "ああ。ひなたが\nすごくいい表情をしていたおかげだな。", "zh": "嗯。多亏了日向刚才的表情特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fd75f1335338f65241d0f1849d4580ab4ae98a253f49fdbc53d506550afc3cd0", "ja": "スタッフさん達も、ひなたの笑顔が\n自然だったって、褒めてたよ。", "zh": "工作人员们也夸你了，说你的笑容很自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "18bc56351c2eacd170afcdbc1bf4b1f7fcaf2a9c6a79f112357dc8bad9f44338", "ja": "自然な笑顔……。そう言われると、\nなんだかちょっと恥ずかしいべさ……。", "zh": "自然的笑容……你这么一说，我突然觉得有点不好意思了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f6c2adbe4f220c7d4b1fdbc565c43a991325a9fdeac9a8337f5e4adadd6a00f1", "ja": "恥ずかしい？", "zh": "觉得不好意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "1fd6e765e76fedab0590e210eb6085f174826342b448853c26b380ff1327cc93", "ja": "うん……あのね、撮影中の笑顔は、がんばったんじゃ\nなくて、本当に笑顔になっちゃっただけなんだわぁ。", "zh": "嗯……那个呀，拍摄时的笑容不是\n我特意努力做出来的，只是不知不觉就真的笑出来了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "440ba48700fd9645c9c6a7642be8ec14f467f41e7cd619dff3aa0afab58e733d", "ja": "お布団がなまらふかふかで、\nお日様のいい匂いがいっぱいして……。", "zh": "被子软乎乎的，还满是太阳晒过的香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "87ccb9b8203168b7a971194e607305e30327a52309c7963c9d547d09df9a566c", "ja": "それがうれしくて、思わず\nほっぺたが緩んでしまってねぇ。", "zh": "因为那让人很开心，不知不觉就笑得合不拢嘴了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e4c03f0c657787c462da30f72bf9181186bfa099dbc82eef1bab1d593577a358", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。だから撮影中も、\n気持ちよさそうにもしてたのか。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。所以拍摄的时候，你也一直一副很享受的样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "e1c05fc53be89fa7b958960720126a987668948116e287c756bdb4aeaa59ffe9", "ja": "うん。なんだか、田舎を思い出したべさ。お日様の\n匂いはおんなしだなぁって思ったら、うれしくてねぇ。", "zh": "嗯。总觉得想起了乡下。想到太阳的味道还是一样的，就觉得好开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "ad899679294828544de6d8525b3ae4b517b39a841427863bfc4c32506bc7b2ea", "ja": "お仕事なのに、元気をもらっちゃったべさ。", "zh": "明明是在工作，却反而从中获得了活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55b52a2d55336101d58c0509f5381fca858ba433d38479af6b68c266cc365ed2", "ja": "いいんじゃないか。スタッフさんも、\nひなたのために干しておいてくれたんだろうし。", "zh": "挺好的嘛。工作团队也是\n为了日向才特意晒好的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "14f698f37f74386de8a6312d915fd5c44eeb9440a4dac13e3adecdb3e2633931", "ja": "そっかぁ。ならあたし、スタッフさん達へ、\nお布団を干しておいてくれた、お礼を言いたいなぁ。", "zh": "这样啊。那我想向工作人员们道谢，谢谢他们帮我把被子晒好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3e870d4d4f75665bc13c654ce6ba3c3418f4c29de5ceea1e1c8351382301f569", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，挺好的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1015_staff", "source_sha256": "df3955437d149fdb7e9a217ca4dac636da73d58ac5a84ccfd021067cd7c8d7fa", "ja": "お待たせしました！　撮影再開しますので、\n木下さん、準備お願いしまーす！", "zh": "让您久等了！马上重新开始拍摄，\n木下小姐，请准备一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "61ea77e97c07d2d40fa9ad45c61fa4e90368cc02a518b75071509243b8c06697", "ja": "ありゃ……ちょっこし、タイミングが悪かったねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀……稍微有点不是时候呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fe4a3b43d7a39cf6477fcc6d708888efc9b50da4d99fe6a31efee17ed7d067cb", "ja": "お礼は、撮影が終わってからにしようか。\n焦らなくても、まだまだ時間はあるしな。", "zh": "谢礼就等拍摄结束后再说吧。\n不用着急，时间还多着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "592308bad1f307a60f684e156cbe16772bcb58f272beb397efa0d9bbefe274b9", "ja": "そうだねぇ。お日様のパワーをいっぱいもらったし、\nお仕事がんばるべさ！", "zh": "是呀。已经充分获得阳光的力量了，  \n接下来要努力工作啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "a4d9f08bb0978d6b949fc4ae986b0b0f197fa2d690c7a71d31812b1da923c02a", "ja": "それじゃ、行ってくるねぇ、{$P$}！", "zh": "那我先走啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0303_1020_p", "source_sha256": "962f407fa00a25c8aff9011a5818a051b9804d555780fa0079cfe9bba78fda7e", "ja": "（後半の撮影でも、ひなたは心からの笑顔だった。\nスタッフさんの気遣いには、本当に感謝だな）", "zh": "（后半段的拍摄中，日向也一直发自内心地笑着。真的很感谢工作人员的关心）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
